OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Text_MarisolIntro::
	.string "Cold, isn't it? I stopped\n"
	.string "noticing a long time ago.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Text_MarisolDefeat::
	.string "Ah. Warm, for a moment.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Text_MarisolPostBattle::
	.string "This is the MORO. She made the\n"
	.string "Valencia run, twice a week.\p"
	.string "She still does. We just never\n"
	.string "reach the other end.$"

OrangeIslands_Moro_GhostShip_Text_Gaffer::
	.string "GAFFER: I rowed out here on a\n"
	.string "dare and I'm not going below.\p"
	.string "You hear them moving. All the\n"
	.string "way down. All night.\p"
	.string "If you go, go armed.$"
